  "body": "**The request (mkinney, 2026-11-15):** \"Would it make sense to add icons for the operations and what not to the docs?\"\n\nThe app has 93 icon PNGs under `assets/ui/` (operations, tools, toolbar, tree). The user guide (`site/content/guide/`) shows none of them. A user reads \"2D Adaptive\" in the guide but cannot match it to the button in the app.\n\nWanted:\n- Each operation section in `operations-*.md` starts with the operation's icon, the same file the app draws (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/icons.rs` names them).\n- The toolbar or tree icons appear inline where the guide names a control (\"press **Generate** ![](...)\").\n- Copy the icons into `site/static/icons/` at build time, or reference one shared folder, so they never drift from the app. Prefer a `zola` shortcode `{{ icon(name=\"op-adaptive2d\") }}`.\n- Licence: the icons are Tabler (MIT) or original (`assets/ui/LICENSES.md`). Keep that file's notice reachable from the site.\n\nDone means: every operation page shows its icon, the shortcode exists, `zola build` passes, and an icon renamed in the app breaks the site build (or a test), not silently.\n",
